## Worked example
For a diff introducing an unchecked divisor, a good comment looks like:

```json
{
  "file": "src/main/java/com/example/Calculator.java",
  "line": 10,
  "severity": "BLOCKER",
  "category": "BUG",
  "body": "Division by zero when divisor is zero",
  "suggestedFix": "Guard the divisor against zero"
}
```

Note the precise file and line, the severity choice, and the concrete suggested fix.
Only report findings that are actually present in the diff; do not invent problems.

